    "description": "<p>You wrap yourself in liquid metal that acts to defend you when threatened.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, your <strong>Defense </strong>increases by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase your <strong>Defense</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p><p>You may end the spell early to negate an attack, sacrificing the armor in the process.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.8e6AmHl8BorWT16b]{Reactive Armor}</p>",
